# Claude Workspace — gitignore

# Archive folders (personal history — don't push to public repos)
notes/archive/
planner/archive/
tasks/archive/
tracker/archive/

# Actual note and plan content (personal — keep local)
notes/*.md
planner/today.md
tasks/tasks.md
tracker/items.md

# Keep the structure and skills — those are the reusable parts
# Remove lines above if you WANT to track your content in git

